OL,3,GNEWSASusan Boyle documentary to air on
OL,4,ABBC at Hogmanay
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new documentary about the life of
OL,7,FScottish singer Susan Boyle will be
OL,8,Fpart of the BBC's Hogmanay TV line-up,
OL,9,Fit has been announced.
OL,11,FThere's Only One Susan Boyle, which
OL,12,Fwill air on BBC One Scotland, will
OL,13,Fexplore her journey from obscurity in
OL,14,Fthe West Lothian village of Blackburn
OL,15,Fto worldwide stardom after her
OL,16,Fappearance on Britain's Got Talent in
OL,17,F2009.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
