OL,3,GNEWSASusan Boyle documentary to air on
OL,4,ABBC at Hogmanay
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer rise to fame came after her
OL,7,Fperformance of I Dreamed A Dream, which
OL,8,Fshocked the judges on the talent show
OL,9,Fand has since been viewed more than 260
OL,10,Fmillion times online.
OL,12,FWhile eventually losing out to dance
OL,13,Fgroup Diversity in the final of the
OL,14,Fshow, she has gone on to sell millions
OL,15,Fof records and been nominated for two
OL,16,FGrammy Awards.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
